    "voice": "produce_events/201200601/2012006010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──凛世……？\r\n……うわっ、すまん。少しうとうとしたみたいだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012006010040,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "また……\r\n夜を徹しての……お仕事だったのですね……",
    "charAnim1": "shy3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "017",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200601/2012006010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ま、まぁな\r\nけど、凛世も随分早いんじゃないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012006010050,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "いえ……\r\n凛世は、プロデューサーさまを……案じております……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200601/2012006010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺は全然問題ないよ\r\nありがとな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんか、\r\n風鈴の音が気持ちよくてさ……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012006010060,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "……はい\r\nとても……よい音色です……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200601/2012006010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さすが凛世の目利きだな\r\nおかげで、事務所がちょっと涼しくなったみたいだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012006010070,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "いえ……買ってくださったのは……\r\nプロデューサーさまです……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200601/2012006010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、\r\nだって凛世、見入っちゃって動かなかったじゃないか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012006010080,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "そ……そのような……\r\n……申し訳ございません……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200601/2012006010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "謝ることないって\r\nいい買い物だったなって思ってるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012006010090,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "プロデューサーさま……\r\nはい……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200601/2012006010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……なんか、ガラスって\r\n光が通ると、波打っているように見えるよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012006010100,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "はい──",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200601/2012006010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012006010110,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "硝子は……\r\n長い時をかけて……流れている……",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200601/2012006010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012006010120,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "とも申します……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200601/2012006010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012006010130,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "凛世も……\r\nつまびらかには……存じませんが……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200601/2012006010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012006010140,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "ゆるぎないように見えて……\r\nまことには……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200601/2012006010140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012006010150,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "千年も……万年もかけて……\r\n流れ続けるのだと……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200601/2012006010150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "へぇー……！\r\nガラスは流れている、か……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "じゃあ本当かどうか、一緒に見てようか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012006010160,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200601/2012006010160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012006010170,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "プロデューサーさま……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200601/2012006010170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012006010180,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "プロデューサーさまと……\r\n風鈴が……流れてゆくのを……？",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200601/2012006010180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、いや、はは……\r\n千年も万年も、ってわけにはいかないけどさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012006010190,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "いえ……\r\n凛世は……貴方さまがいれば……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200601/2012006010190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、そうか……\r\nすまんな、冗談だったんだけど、真剣に考えてくれたんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……じゃあ、ちょっとだけ眺めていような",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012006010200,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "プロデューサーさま……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200601/2012006010200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012006010210,
    "speaker": "凛世",
