    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200601/2012006010220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……俺たちにはわからないけど、\r\n今も少しずつ流れて、変わっていってるってことだよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012006010230,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "はい……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200601/2012006010230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんていうか、\r\n途方もない話だな…………ふあぁ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012006010240,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "プロデューサーさま……？\r\nまだ……お休みになられた方が……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200601/2012006010240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大丈夫だよ、凛世\r\nまだ何分も経ってないしな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012006010250,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "ですが……",
